# Audit artefacts written by tools/e2e.mjs. These two lines are the whole reason
# a blanket `*.png` rule ever existed here, and the blanket rule was the bug: it
# also matched public/icons/*.png (named by manifest.webmanifest, linked by
# index.html) and assets/brain-source.png (the art `npm run derive:brain` reads),
# so a fresh clone shipped a page whose icons 404 and whose PWA install had none.
# Ignore the artefacts by name; never ignore an image type the app ships.
*.audit.png
e2e-final.png

node_modules/.vite
